data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr238"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasyglags/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 15.79%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr239/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="239" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr239"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfaspmqec6/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14.76%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr240/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="240" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr240"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasmacblq/"></a>5-босқич</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr241/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="241" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr241"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasttg2ss/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15.45%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr242/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="242" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr242"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasyiwdww/"></a>Мажбурий ижро бюроси</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr243/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="243" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr243"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas51s93x/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 51.97%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr244/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="244" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr244"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasxng0mt/"></a>Рўйхатдан ўтказган органнинг билдиришномасини олган санадан бошлаб иш юритишда ижро ҳужжатини давлат ижрочиси қонунда белгиланган тартибда ижро ишини тугаллаш ва белгиланган тартибда тугатишни ижро этиш учун ижро ҳужжатини тугатувчига юбориш.</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 1.3%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr245/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="245" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr245"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasogt5wf/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15.79%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr246/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="246" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr246"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas5xtkyl/"></a>10 (ўн) кун</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 14.76%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr247/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="247" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr247"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas3spgip/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr248/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="248" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr248"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfassc7g83/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 15.45%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr249/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="249" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr249"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasr3h6su/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr250/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="250" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr250"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas0cofs8/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 51.97%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr251/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="251" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr251"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasucf3g5/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width: 1.3%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr252/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="252" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr252"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasxz1yv7/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 15.79%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr253/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="253" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr253"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasy5whad/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14.76%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr254/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="254" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr254"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfaswu5f6n/"></a>6-босқич</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr255/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="255" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr255"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasb3626y/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15.45%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr256/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="256" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr256"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas5887nc/"></a>Давлат солиқ хизмати органлари</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr257/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="257" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr257"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasxy77lq/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 51.97%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr258/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="258" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr258"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas3u36qb/"></a>Тизим орқали хабардор қилинган кундан бошлаб тижорат ташкилотининг молия-хўжалик фаолиятини текширишга (тафтиш қилишга) киришиш, йиллик айланмаси охирги уч йил ичида бир миллиард сўмгача бўлган, солиқ маслаҳатчилари томонидан солиқларга доир хулоса бериш орқали ихтиёрий тугатилиш истагини билдирган тижорат ташкилотлардан (таваккалчилик даражаси юқори бўлган солиқ тўловчи бундан мустасно) ташқари.</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 1.3%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr259/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="259" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr259"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas8bw8ri/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15.79%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr260/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="260" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr260"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasgl9ghq/"></a>3 (уч) иш кунида</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 14.76%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr261/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="261" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr261"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasromvzh/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr262/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="262" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr262"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasg2f9nb/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 15.45%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr263/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="263" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr263"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfase56gdb/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr264/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="264" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr264"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasfd6g6k/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 51.97%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr265/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="265" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr265"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasffbgk8/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width: 1.3%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr266/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="266" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr266"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasiv4enr/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 15.79%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr267/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="267" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr267"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasru6eqe/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14.76%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr268/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="268" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr268"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasy0rp89/"></a>7-босқич</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr269/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="269" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr269"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfask1rvzr/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15.45%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr270/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="270" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr270"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas2auxkf/"></a>Тугатувчи</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr271/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="271" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr271"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas8cyc8d/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 51.97%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr272/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="272" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr272"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas8l00p4/"></a>Оралиқ тугатиш баланси тасдиқлангандан кейин барча кредиторларни уларнинг талаблари эътироф этилганлиги ёки рад қилинганлиги, эътироф этилган талаблар суммаси ҳақида ёзма (электрон) равишда тасдиқномани олган ҳолда хабардор қилиш.</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 1.3%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr273/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="273" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr273"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasu8we7g/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15.79%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr274/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="274" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr274"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasl6fu2g/"></a>5 (беш) иш кунида</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 14.76%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr275/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="275" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr275"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasgf5lh8/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr276/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="276" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr276"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas77cgx2/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 15.45%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr277/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="277" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr277"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasvqegda/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr278/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="278" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr278"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas7ty9rx/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 51.97%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr279/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="279" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr279"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfaser4c90/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width: 1.3%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr280/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="280" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr280"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfashp80gm/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 15.79%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr281/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="281" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr281"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasslx340/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14.76%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr282/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="282" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr282"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasbgs1p7/"></a>8-босқич</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr283/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="283" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr283"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasluhoeq/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15.45%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr284/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="284" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr284"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas1eg9eq/"></a>Тугатувчи</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr285/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="285" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr285"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfastp9r4a/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 51.97%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr286/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="286" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr286"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasi1fkod/"></a>Мол-мулкни бошқа кредиторларга беришда унинг баҳолаш суммаси эътироф этилган талабларни тўлаш ҳисобига қўшиш, баҳолаш суммаси билан талаб миқдори ўртасида тижорат ташкилоти фойдасига ҳосил бўлган тафовутни кредитордан қабул қилиб олиш.</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 1.3%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr287/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="287" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr287"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfascetkcb/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15.79%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr288/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="288" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr288"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasrbztku/"></a>5 (беш) иш кунида</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 14.76%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr289/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="289" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr289"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfaslgusrx/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr290/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="290" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr290"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasn19x97/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 15.45%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr291/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="291" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr291"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasfagexh/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr292/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="292" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr292"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasb9iggh/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 51.97%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr293/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="293" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr293"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfaszezb1g/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width: 1.3%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr294/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="294" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr294"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasibr44p/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 15.79%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr295/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="295" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr295"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas5vzpvi/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14.76%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr296/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="296" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr296"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasg1a3er/"></a>9-босқич</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr297/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="297" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr297"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasunz3sv/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15.45%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr298/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="298" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr298"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas0ywz7m/"></a>Давлат солиқ хизмати органлари</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr299/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="299" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr299"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasrifucv/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 51.97%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr300/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="300" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr300"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasgyy0gy/"></a>Тугатиш баланси қабул қилингандан кейин тижорат ташкилотининг солиқлар ва йиғимлар бўйича қарзи бўлмаган тақдирда, солиқлар ва бошқа мажбурий тўловлар бўйича қарзи йўқлиги тўғрисидаги хулосани тугатувчига хамда Тизим орқали рўйхатдан ўтказувчи органга юбориш.</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 1.3%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr301/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="301" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr301"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasodxfih/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15.79%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr302/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="302" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr302"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasf270gp/"></a>1 (бир) иш кунида</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 14.76%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr303/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="303" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr303"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasilpyim/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr304/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="304" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr304"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasz2xiip/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 15.45%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr305/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="305" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr305"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas19zcu4/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr306/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="306" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr306"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasv0oc1a/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 51.97%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr307/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="307" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr307"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasd1euyx/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width: 1.3%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr308/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="308" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr308"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasm9qxh6/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 15.79%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr309/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="309" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr309"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasnpa4yp/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14.76%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr310/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="310" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr310"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasd53wg6/"></a>10-босқич</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr311/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="311" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr311"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasgs4ykc/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15.45%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr312/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="312" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr312"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfaszeg832/"></a>Мажбурий ижро бюроси</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr313/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="313" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr313"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfaszd93rk/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 51.97%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr314/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="314" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr314"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas1wxhi6/"></a>Бажарилмаган ижро ҳужжати Мажбурий ижро бюросининг иш юритувида мавжуд бўлмаган тақдирда, ижро этилмаган тегишли ижро ҳужжати иш юритувида мавжуд эмаслиги ҳақида тугатувчига ҳамда Тизим орқали рўйхатдан ўтказувчи органга хабарнома юбориш.</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 1.3%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr315/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="315" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr315"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasx9lqmz/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15.79%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr316/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="316" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr316"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfaspf43gk/"></a>3 (уч) иш кунида</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 14.76%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr317/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="317" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr317"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas8h8ugv/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr318/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="318" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr318"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasm00k8u/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 15.45%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr319/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="319" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr319"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasvx61bk/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr320/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="320" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr320"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas7n5554/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 51.97%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr321/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="321" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr321"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasgrl4kq/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width: 1.3%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr322/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="322" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr322"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas9shvfu/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 15.79%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr323/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="323" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr323"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasmr76qm/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14.76%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr324/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="324" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr324"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas79r7zt/"></a>11-босқич</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr325/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="325" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr325"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfaswaotx7/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15.45%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr326/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="326" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr326"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas7dp6y6/"></a>Тугатувчи</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr327/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="327" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr327"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasghbzyu/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 51.97%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr328/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="328" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr328"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasl7fkc4/"></a>Давлат солиқ хизмати органи ва Мажбурий ижро бюросининг хабарномаси олингандан кейин тижорат ташкилотининг асосий ҳисобварағи очилган тижорат банкига уни ёпиш тўғрисида мурожаат қилиш ва тижорат банклари томонидан тижорат ташкилотига тегишли бўлган ҳисобварақ ёпилганлиги тўғрисида маълумотномани олиш.</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 1.3%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr329/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="329" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr329"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasqkqeh8/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15.79%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr330/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="330" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr330"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas9n4scr/"></a>1 (бир) иш кунида</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 14.76%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr331/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="331" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr331"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasnunmeh/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr332/" data-role="phrase-anch