18618/bssPhr339/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="339" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr339"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas9eq6uv/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15.45%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr340/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="340" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr340"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas8yupda/"></a>Тугатувчи</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr341/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="341" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr341"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasfab0zp/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 51.97%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr342/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="342" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr342"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfaszecx4e/"></a>Асосий ҳисобварағи ёпилгандан кейин давлат архивига тижорат ташкилотининг қонун ҳужжатларида назарда тутилган барча бухгалтерия ва бошқа ҳужжатларини топшириш.</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 1.3%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr343/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="343" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr343"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasewyzve/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15.79%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr344/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="344" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr344"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasio05h1/"></a>3 (уч) иш кунида</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 14.76%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr345/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="345" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr345"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasdgf9y5/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr346/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="346" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr346"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasp56f3o/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 15.45%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr347/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="347" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr347"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasm5gm16/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr348/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="348" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr348"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas8rb4sn/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 51.97%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr349/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="349" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr349"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasvbfos0/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width: 1.3%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr350/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="350" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr350"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfaspq5vl8/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 15.79%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr351/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="351" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr351"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasltci55/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 14.76%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr352/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="352" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr352"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfashx8sua/"></a>13-босқич</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr353/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="353" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr353"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfaseb075c/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15.45%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr354/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="354" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr354"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasu4gyg0/"></a>Рўйхатдан ўтказувчи орган</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr355/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="355" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr355"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasahn68h/"></a>(Давлат хизматлари маркази)</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 0.14%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr356/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="356" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr356"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasoupucx/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 51.97%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr357/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="357" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr357"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas3ka42c/"></a>Барча ҳужжатлар олингандан кейин Тизим орқали текшириш хамда давлат реестрига тижорат ташкилоти тугатилганлиги тўғрисидаги ёзувларни киритиш.</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 1.3%;"><a data-anchor="/docum