document/90/18618/bssPhr507/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="507" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr507"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas7humh4/"></a>2-босқич</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 2%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr508/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="508" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr508"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas5w0u00/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 20%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr509/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="509" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr509"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasro7tas/"></a>Туман (шаҳар) солиқ инспекциялари</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 2%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr510/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="510" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr510"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfass38gal/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 40%;"><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr511/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="511" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr511"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas9t2ib4/"></a>Фаолият кўрсатмаётган кичик тадбиркорлик субъектлари рўйхатида кўрсатилган корхоналар тўғрисидаги маълумотларни маҳаллага бириктирилган туман (шаҳар) ҳокимининг ёрдамчисига тақдим этади.</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 2%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr512/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="512" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr512"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasbc9643/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 1