 bdBottom" style="width: 18%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr520/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="520" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr520"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasyzuuph/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 13%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr521/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="521" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr521"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasg68cgd/"></a>3-босқич</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 2%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr522/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="522" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr522"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasc4o3su/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 20%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr523/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="523" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr523"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasehu407/"></a>Туман (шаҳар) ҳокимининг ёрдамчиси</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 2%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr524/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="524" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr524"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfashld9v8/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 40%;"><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr525/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="525" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr525"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas4gndws/"></a>Фаолият кўрсатмаётган кичик тадбиркорлик субъектлари раҳбари ва (ёки) таъсисчилари (иштирокчилари) иштирокида фаолият юритмаслик 