="/document/90/18618/bssPhr539/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="539" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr539"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas00lb1w/"></a>Корхоналарнинг фаолият юритмаслик сабаблари кўрсатилган ҳолда уларнинг фаолиятини тиклаш бўйича туман (шаҳар) ҳокимининг биринчи ўринбосарига ахборот ва таклифлар киритади.</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 2%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr540/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="540" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr540"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfas4cfnfv/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 18%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr541/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="541" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr541"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasqw7gbs/"></a>Ўн беш иш кунида</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 13%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr542/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="542" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr542"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasdwrnc6/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width: 2%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr543/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="543" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr543"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasdrdagn/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" style="width: 20%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr544/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="544" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr544"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/dfasuzx2iz/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width: 2%;"><a data-anchor="/document/90/18618/bssPhr545/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="545" data-dwh-source-type-favorite